readme="""# FLIXORA — Website & PWA Starter
One destination. Endless entertainment.

## Run
Use a web server, not file://:
    python3 -m http.server 8080
Open http://localhost:8080

## Free publishing
Upload all files to GitHub Pages, Netlify Drop, Cloudflare Pages or another static host. On Android Chrome use Install app / Add to Home screen. On iPhone Safari use Share > Add to Home Screen.

## Included
Responsive cinematic UI; search/filter/sort; detail pages; official outbound links; local watchlist/recent/profile; legal downloads with progress, IndexedDB saved library, playback, device-save, deletion and history; official service download guides; local admin editor and JSON export; PWA shell.

## Important limitations
- Demo metadata/service associations/ratings are illustrative, not live availability guarantees.
- Connect a licensed metadata/provider API for current regional availability. Follow API attribution/caching/commercial terms. Do not expose secret keys in frontend code.
- Accounts/sync are not implemented. Use a suitable auth/database free tier with server-side rules for production.
- The admin is LOCAL and NOT secure public authentication.
- Use only owned/licensed posters, trailers and downloadable files. Generated CSS fallback posters avoid copying service artwork.
- In-browser downloads require CORS permission from the file host. If blocked, the official source opens externally.
- iPhone saving depends on Safari/file type; users may need Share > Save to Files.
- Browser storage is not DRM. Never bypass protected streaming downloads.
- PWA shell works offline after first load; external sites/streaming need internet and relevant subscriptions.
- Language preference is stored; full translations are not included.
- Replace support@example.com before launch.
- Large MKV/MOV samples may not play in every browser. Provide licensed H.264/AAC MP4 renditions for compatibility.

## Legal samples
Big Buck Bunny, Sintel and Tears of Steel: Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0. Preserve attribution/licence terms.
Night of the Living Dead: commonly treated as public domain in the US; verify rights in each target country.

## Cost
Static hosting can be KSh 0 on free tiers. Live APIs, auth, database bandwidth, media storage/CDN and custom domains may cost money as usage grows. Disclose limits before enabling paid infrastructure.

FLIXORA is independent and not affiliated with listed services. All trademarks belong to their owners. No rights to commercial streaming libraries are granted.
"""
